  "metadata": {
    "ip_address": "192.168.1.1",
    "user_agent": "Mozilla/5.0...",
    "device_fingerprint": "fp_abc123"
  }
}
```

Response:
```
{
  "fraud_score": 0.12,
  "risk_level": "low",
