// The actual audit evidence must be produced by direct tool calls; this file
// exists to document intended sequencing and data contracts.

/**
 * Steps per user (documented):
 * 1) Validate email -> store result
 * 2) Query auth methods -> if missing, create user -> store identifiers
 * 3) Generate secure temporary password -> record length/charset policy
 * 4) Send OTP to QA phone -> record delivery result
 * 5) Simulate login risk check -> record risk signals
 * 6) Validate phone and IP metadata -> store raw findings
 * 7) Aggregate raw JSON into reports/audit_run_001.json and append narrative to logs/audit.log
